#3100
brother drowned~
a drowned brother~
A drowned brother of the cloister stands swaying in the water.
~
    The flood took the cloister's brothers where they stood at their
prayers, and some of them are still at them.  This one's robes have
gone to black weed about the waist and its face to nothing below the
chin, but the hands are still folded, and it opens them only to
correct an intruder's posture.
~
