#3101
choirist salt~
a salt-crusted choirist~
A salt-crusted choirist stands with its mouth open.
~
    The choir drowned in their stalls, and the water has pickled them
where they sat.  This one's mouth is open at the note it died on,
and it has been singing it, without pause, ever since.  The note is
not a note any more.
~
