#3102
ghoul reclamation bloated~
a bloated reclamation ghoul~
A bloated reclamation ghoul rises out of the green water.
~
    The cloister reclaimed its dead twice over:  once in consecrated
ground, and once when the flood moved them.  What comes up out of the
cistern now is vast and soft and patient, and it goes about the
cloister putting things back where they were, which is why the
chapters are still arranged in order.
~
