swarm leech cistern~
a cistern leech swarm~
A black swarm of cistern leeches turns in the water.
~
    Not one animal but ten thousand, moving as a single slow ring in
the flooded cistern.  The swarm keeps to the deep water, mostly, and
it feeds on whatever the flood brings down to it.  It has learned the
sound of boots on flagstones.
~
