#3104
librarian drowned stacks~
the Librarian of the Drowned Stacks~
The Librarian of the Drowned Stacks stands among her drying lines.
~
    The Librarian drowned at her desk and has never left it.  She wears
what is left of a grey habit and a chain of office, and she has spent
every year since separating what can be saved from what cannot.  Her
opinions about readers who handle vellum with wet hands are strongly
held and no longer silent.
~
