#3106
brother ulmot keeper bells~
Brother Ulmot, Keeper of the Bells~
Brother Ulmot, Keeper of the Bells, stands among the sunken bells.
~
    The last brother to serve the cloister's bells, and still serving
them.  Ulmot's robes are heavy with the water he never comes out of,
and his hands are huge and scarred from a lifetime of bell metal.  He
taps each of the buried bells in turn as he walks the undercroft, and
he has not liked the sound of the great bell for some years now.
~
