warden green nave~
the Green Warden of the Nave~
The Green Warden of the Nave rises out of the flooded aisle.
~
    The nave's great crucifix was carried off by the flood and never
recovered, and the thing that guards the aisle where it stood is not
a man.  It is woven of flood weed and sunken timbers in the shape of
a tall figure, and it will not let the nave be emptied of what
remains in it.
~
