#3119
abbess drowned~
the Abbess Drowned~
The Abbess Drowned stands beside the sarcophagus of Abbot Mael.
~
    The cloister's last Abbess kept her rule after the flood came, and
she keeps it still.  Her vestments are green-black and move as if
there were a current in still water;  the crozier in her hand is the
one from the sarcophagus, taken up again.  She regards the living as
a Prioress regards latecomers to the office, and she is not pleased.
~
